        "## Handling erro cases\n\nquando using extended thinking, keep in mind:\n\n1. **mínimo budget**: The mínimo thinking budget is 1,024 tokens. We suggest starting at the mínimo e increasing incrementally para encontrar the optimal range.\n\n2. **incompatível Recursos**: Thinking isn't compatível com temperature, top_p, ou top_k modifications, e you cannot pre-fill responses.\n\n3. **Pricing**: Extended thinking tokens contagem towards the context janela e are billed as saída tokens. They also contagem towards your rate limits.\n\nFor mais details on extended thinking com tool use, Veja o \"Extended Thinking com Tool Use\" notebook."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": nulo,
      "metadata": {
        "vscode": {
          "languageId": "python"
        }
      },
      "outputs": [
        {
          "nome": "stdout",
          "output_type": "stream",
          "text": [
            "\n",
            "Erro with too small thinking budget: Erro code: 400 - {'tipo': 'Erro', 'Erro': {'tipo': 'invalid_request_error', 'message': 'thinking.enabled.budget_tokens: entrada should be greater than or equal to 1024'}}\n",
            "\n",
